{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れさまぁやっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"blogコメントありがとーごじゃります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも大喜びでしゅ\nこれからもめっちゃ頑張りまあやぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが教えてくれた美味しい食べ物！\nたべるしかぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ダンブルじぃじ(高山かずみ)と一緒にお好み焼きを食べにいきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと今日は\n『ダンブルじぃじ』\nじゃなくて\n『かずみん』\nってかこー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃおいしかったぁーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"御好み焼きやモンジャヤキ食べた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんが美味しいとこ調べてくれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後にあんこま巻き？\n食べたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作り途中！\n出来上がりは..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃおいしかったぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また食べにいこうねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとここで言わせてほしいんだけど........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんちょー好い人なの〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相談とかも真剣に聞いてくれて..................。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のことみたいに喜んでくれたり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれは、まあやだから！\nとかじゃなくて、誰にでも、そういう風に接してくれて、\nそして、言うまでもないが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『有り得ないくらい優しい』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、弱音とかはかなくて.........\n七福神としてめっちゃ頑張ってるカズミン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはマアヤにも甘えてねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやもカズミンの力になれたらいいなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅れてごめん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雲ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもわちゃわちゃして楽しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雲ちゃんとはよく、バスの席がとなりだよねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんめいだピョーン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度も一緒だといいねっ！\nまた勉強教えてー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は眼鏡がなくて、見れたせんでしたぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでしっつもーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近見た面白いテレビは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では待ってまぁす！\n私は、\n『あっこと僕らが生きた夏』\nを録画してて、この前その前編を見ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動すぎて泣けました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/23/3252557/0018.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}